WEBVTT

00:11:59.339 --> 00:12:02.551
we can all be better at looking.

00:12:03.177 --> 00:12:05.679
Because this is not a face.

00:12:05.971 --> 00:12:08.724
And when we live like this drawing,

00:12:08.724 --> 00:12:13.979
we miss out on all of the depth
and detail of the world

00:12:13.979 --> 00:12:15.856
and people around us.

00:12:16.398 --> 00:12:17.691
This is a face.

00:12:18.692 --> 00:12:20.194
And this is a face.

00:12:21.695 --> 00:12:24.114
And that is such a face.

00:12:24.156 --> 00:12:25.699
(Laughs)

00:12:26.658 --> 00:12:28.744
And these are faces.